WEBVTT

00:03:59.441 --> 00:04:01.799
and he would go to conferences
around the country,

00:04:01.823 --> 00:04:03.381
and he would stand up and say,

00:04:03.405 --> 00:04:05.468
"You had been looking
for the perfect Pepsi.

00:04:05.492 --> 00:04:06.722
You're wrong.

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:09.254
You should be looking
for the perfect Pepsis."

00:04:09.857 --> 00:04:12.293
And people would look at him
blankly and say,

00:04:12.317 --> 00:04:14.380
"What are you talking about? Craziness."

00:04:14.404 --> 00:04:15.976
And they would say, "Move! Next!"

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.214
Tried to get business,
nobody would hire him --

00:04:18.238 --> 00:04:19.622
he was obsessed, though,

00:04:19.646 --> 00:04:21.653
and he talked about it
and talked about it.

00:04:21.677 --> 00:04:23.470
Howard loves the Yiddish expression

00:04:23.494 --> 00:04:25.976
"To a worm in horseradish,
the world is horseradish."

00:04:26.541 --> 00:04:28.141
This was his horseradish.

00:04:28.165 --> 00:04:29.827
(Laughter)

00:04:29.851 --> 00:04:31.290
He was obsessed with it!